<title>USA: Gibson Greetings Inc Q3 shr doubles.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings Inc Q3 shr doubles.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					 Three Months*   Nine Months*</p>
<p>			   Ended September 30,  Ended September 30,</p>
<p>					     Pro Forma**  Pro Forma**</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p> REVENUES		    $92,551 $89,546    $278,915 $269,733</p>
<p> NET INCOME		    4,054   1,937	15,519   11,459</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER SHARE	 0.25    0.12	  0.95     0.71</p>
<p>Average common shares and</p>
<p>equivalents outstanding  </p>
<p>				  16,293  16,272	16,266   16,197</p>
<p>NOTE - *The company said that because its business is seasonal in nature, the results of interim periods are not necessarily indicative of yearly results. The accompanying financial statements do not include all of the accounting information normally provided in the annual financial statements. Accordingly, these financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements included in the Company's 1995 Annual Report on Form 10-K.</p>
<p>** Pro forma excludes results from Gibson's gift wrap subsidiary, Cleo Inc</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
